#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`ds18x20` --- DS18x20 temperature sensor driver"
msgstr ":mod:`ds18x20` --- driver sensor suhu DS18x20"

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:7
msgid ""
"The :mod:`ds18x20` module provides a driver for the Maxim/Dallas DS18B20, "
"DS18S20 and DS1822 1-Wire digital temperature sensors. It is built on top of"
" the :mod:`onewire` module and supports multiple sensors sharing a single "
"bus."
msgstr ""
"Modul :mod:`ds18x20` menyediakan driver untuk sensor suhu digital 1-Wire "
"Maxim/Dallas DS18B20, DS18S20, dan DS1822. Modul ini dibangun di atas modul "
":mod:`onewire` dan mendukung beberapa sensor yang berbagi satu bus."

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:11
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Contoh::"

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:27
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "Kelas"

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:31
msgid ""
"Construct a DS18x20 driver bound to the given `onewire.OneWire` bus. "
"Multiple DS18x20 sensors may share the same bus."
msgstr ""
"Membuat driver DS18x20 yang terikat ke bus `onewire.OneWire` yang diberikan."
" Beberapa sensor DS18x20 dapat berbagi bus yang sama."

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:36
msgid ""
"Search the underlying 1-Wire bus and return a list of ROM codes that "
"correspond to DS18x20-family devices. Only ROMs whose family code is "
"``0x10`` (DS18S20), ``0x22`` (DS1822) or ``0x28`` (DS18B20) are returned; "
"other 1-Wire devices on the same bus are filtered out."
msgstr ""
"Mencari bus 1-Wire yang mendasarinya dan mengembalikan daftar kode ROM yang "
"sesuai dengan perangkat keluarga DS18x20. Hanya ROM yang kode keluarganya "
"``0x10`` (DS18S20), ``0x22`` (DS1822), atau ``0x28`` (DS18B20) yang "
"dikembalikan; perangkat 1-Wire lain pada bus yang sama disaring."

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:43
msgid ""
"Issue a temperature conversion command to **all** DS18x20 sensors on the bus"
" simultaneously (using SKIP ROM). After calling this method you must wait "
"for the conversion to complete (up to 750 ms at the default 12-bit "
"resolution) before calling :meth:`read_temp`."
msgstr ""
"Mengeluarkan perintah konversi suhu ke **semua** sensor DS18x20 di bus "
"secara bersamaan (menggunakan SKIP ROM). Setelah memanggil metode ini, Anda "
"harus menunggu konversi selesai (hingga 750 ms pada resolusi 12-bit default)"
" sebelum memanggil :meth:`read_temp`\\ ."

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:50
msgid ""
"Read the 9-byte scratchpad from the device addressed by *rom* and return it "
"as a ``bytearray``. The scratchpad CRC is verified; raises :exc:`Exception` "
"with the message ``\"CRC error\"`` on a CRC mismatch."
msgstr ""
"Membaca scratchpad 9-byte dari perangkat yang dialamatkan oleh *rom* dan "
"mengembalikannya sebagai ``bytearray``\\ . CRC scratchpad diverifikasi; "
"memunculkan :exc:`Exception` dengan pesan ``\"CRC error\"`` jika CRC tidak "
"cocok."

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:57
msgid ""
"The returned buffer is the driver's internal buffer and is overwritten by "
"subsequent calls."
msgstr ""
"Buffer yang dikembalikan adalah buffer internal driver dan akan ditimpa oleh"
" pemanggilan berikutnya."

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:62
msgid ""
"Write 3 bytes to the scratchpad of the device addressed by *rom*. *buf* must"
" contain the high alarm trigger (TH), low alarm trigger (TL) and "
"configuration register values."
msgstr ""
"Menulis 3 byte ke scratchpad perangkat yang dialamatkan oleh *rom*\\ . *buf*"
" harus berisi nilai pemicu alarm tinggi (TH), pemicu alarm rendah (TL), dan "
"register konfigurasi."

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:68
msgid ""
"Read the most recently converted temperature from the device addressed by "
"*rom* and return it in degrees Celsius as a ``float``. Handles both DS18S20 "
"(family code ``0x10``) and DS18B20 / DS1822 (family codes ``0x28`` / "
"``0x22``) encodings, including negative temperatures."
msgstr ""
"Membaca suhu yang paling baru dikonversi dari perangkat yang dialamatkan "
"oleh *rom* dan mengembalikannya dalam derajat Celsius sebagai ``float``\\ . "
"Menangani pengkodean DS18S20 (kode keluarga ``0x10``\\ ) dan DS18B20 / "
"DS1822 (kode keluarga ``0x28`` / ``0x22``\\ ), termasuk suhu negatif."

#: ../../library/ds18x20.rst:74
msgid ""
"Call :meth:`convert_temp` and wait for the conversion to finish before "
"calling this method."
msgstr ""
"Panggil :meth:`convert_temp` dan tunggu konversi selesai sebelum memanggil "
"metode ini."
